		{"id":"group-coreru","type":"group","x":80,"y":-880,"width":1435,"height":1130,"label":"Core Runtime"},
		{"id":"group-docshy","type":"group","x":1520,"y":520,"width":800,"height":1180,"label":"Docs Hygiene"},
		{"id":"group-testin","type":"group","x":460,"y":1080,"width":820,"height":1000,"label":"Testing CI"},
		{"id":"group-datalo","type":"group","x":-480,"y":460,"width":560,"height":1053,"label":"Data Logging"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"## Legend\n🔴 **Red** = To Do (ready)\n⬜ **Gray** = Blocked\n🟠 **Orange** = Doing\n🔵 **Cyan** = Ready to review\n🟢 **Green** = Done\n🟣 **Purple** = Proposed by agent","x":-540,"y":-310,"width":380,"height":230,"color":"0"},
		{"id":"canvas-warnings","type":"text","text":"## Warnings\n✓ None","x":-540,"y":-530,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"canvas-errors","type":"text","text":"## Errors\n✓ None","x":-540,"y":-750,"width":380,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5ecc9ac5","type":"text","text":"## DH-02 Update docs for current dashboard and data flow\nRefresh README and visualization docs to reflect modular JS architecture and current supported input formats (.json/.npz/.zip).","x":1560,"y":1030,"width":280,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d66aef11","type":"text","text":"## TC-03 Gate CI with coverage and lint\nExtend CI to run lint/format checks and enforce a minimum coverage threshold after core tests are in place.","x":700,"y":1760,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"55e9bfce","type":"text","text":"## TC-01 Add env contract and mode tests\nAdd tests that assert non-empty observations, consistent step return shapes, and robust current_mode behavior for all sampled actions.","x":960,"y":1214,"width":280,"height":245,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"828f57f8","type":"text","text":"## TC-02 Add logger export regression tests\nAdded focused regression tests in tests/test_logger_exports.py for memory snapshot behavior, JSON serialization plus metadata, NumPy sparc_pack_v1 export and spark_status decomposition, ragged array conversion warnings, invalid metadata handling, and JSON file-write errors. Validation: PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest tests/test_logger_signal_validation.py tests/test_logger_exports.py -q (11 passed).","x":480,"y":1156,"width":360,"height":357,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"4dc71a4c","type":"text","text":"## DH-03 Clean stale repository artifacts\nRemove or relocate stale backup/helper files and outdated references that create maintenance noise and onboarding confusion.","x":2000,"y":1094,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"3d7e31d7","type":"text","text":"## DL-01 Add logger signal validation\nImplemented strict logger schema validation in SimulationLogger. signals_to_log is now validated against EDMState fields plus explicit derived signals (currently: gap_um). Unknown entries now raise ValueError at logger initialization with typo suggestions instead of silently logging None. Added tests in tests/test_logger_signal_validation.py for valid state signals, valid derived signals, unknown signal rejection (gap_width), and typo hints. Validation: pytest tests (28 passed).","x":-420,"y":520,"width":440,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ce58c7a4","type":"text","text":"## DL-02 Replace broad exception swallowing\nReplaced blanket exception swallowing with targeted handling in wire/logger sync paths. In wire module: removed broad try/except pass in state sync; now guards empty position buffer, validates wire_temperature type/shape, and falls back with actionable warnings when in-place sync fails. In logger module: replaced broad except Exception handlers with specific exception tuples for array conversion, JSON serialization, metadata extraction, zip writing, and spark_status decomposition. Added explicit malformed spark_status warnings with index/context and aggregate count. Added regression test test_logger_warns_on_malformed_spark_status. Validation: pytest tests (29 passed).","x":-405,"y":994,"width":410,"height":465,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"6717200d","type":"text","text":"## DH-01 Align examples with controller and logging schema\nUnify controller sign convention across examples and remove/replace invalid logged signals to match the validated schema.","x":2000,"y":540,"width":280,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0486f4c3","type":"text","text":"## CR-03 Fix package version metadata lookup\nUpdated __version__ resolution to check installed distributions in order: wedm-learning-environment, then wedm fallback. Removed forced 0.dev override path. Validation: pytest tests (24 passed) and import check returns wedm.__version__ = 0.2.0.","x":515,"y":-852,"width":280,"height":365,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f8392039","type":"text","text":"## CR-01 Define Gym API contract (observations + reward)\nImplement stable observation_space, _get_obs payload, and non-placeholder reward semantics for training and diagnostics.","x":995,"y":-564,"width":360,"height":248,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"28c863c6","type":"text","text":"## CR-02 Enforce valid current-mode handling\n- Added early validation in _apply_action() that rejects current_mode values without crater data, raising ValueError with list of valid modes for agent parsers. \n- Exposed valid_current_modes set on WireEDMEnv derived from crater_data.json keys. Fixed test_env_step to use valid modes. Added\n- TestCurrentModeValidation with tests for valid modes accepted, invalid modes rejected, and error message content. \n- Validation: pytest tests (39 passed).","x":120,"y":-195,"width":420,"height":400,"color":"4"}
	],
